Wrong (A): FMV at conversion is used for the loss basis, not the gain basis. Using FMV for gain would understate the taxpayer''s investment in the property.
Wrong (B): The lower-of rule applies only when determining a loss, not when determining a gain on converted property.
Wrong (D): Averaging cost and FMV has no basis in tax law and would produce an arbitrary result that neither Section 1015 nor Treas. Reg. Section 1.165-9 supports.$EXPL$
